# shellcheck release assets goh-floors may install, each verified against its sha256 (G7).
# Columns (TAB): tool, version, platform, sha256 of shellcheck-v<version>.<platform>.tar.gz.
# The floor lives in gates/required_tools.tsv; a floor raised past every version here is refused by
# floors.sh, and tests/test_goh_floors_action.py is red until this file names one for each platform.
# Source: the GitHub release asset digests (gh release view v<version> -R koalaman/shellcheck).
shellcheck	0.11.0	linux.x86_64	b7af85e41cc99489dcc21d66c6d5f3685138f06d34651e6d34b42ec6d54fe6f6
shellcheck	0.11.0	linux.aarch64	68a8133197a50beb8803f8d42f9908d1af1c5540d4bb05fdfca8c1fa47decefc
shellcheck	0.11.0	darwin.aarch64	339b930feb1ea764467013cc1f72d09cd6b869ebf1013296ba9055ab2ffbd26f
